   Preconditions: origin_availability_locked OA, destination_availability_locked DA, origin_availability_node_linked OA origin_node_alpha, destination_availability_node_linked DA destination_node_alpha, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed OA, destination_availability_confirmed DA, transport_leg_available transport_leg_alpha.
