We have OA task profile linked from step 3.

Effect: transport_leg_loading_authorized.

Now mark origin availability dispatch ready:

15. mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha
   Precondition: origin_availability_locked OA, origin_availability_confirmed OA, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready OA.
